---
import Root from '../layouts/Root.astro';
---

<style>
  .links {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-evenly;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .button {
    margin-top: 0 !important;
  }

  .links li {
    list-style: none;
  }

  .links li > a {
    color: #b7d3f6;
  }
  .links li > a:hover {
    color: white;
  }
</style>

<Root title="Home">
  <header class="header">
    <img class="masthead" src="/datcode-ascii.svg" alt="" role="presentation" />
    <div class="content" visually-hidden>
      <h1>Dat Code</h1>
      <span>2016 to Infinity</span>
    </div>
  </header>
  <main class="max-w-[37.5rem] ms-[clamp(4%,calc((100%-600px)/2),8%)] me-auto">
    <p>
      Welcome to the Black Tech Strike Force Discord community—a dynamic and
      inclusive space where Black and Brown technologists thrive. Here, we
      celebrate all aspects of technology, from coding and design to data
      science and beyond. Whether you're a seasoned developer or just starting
      out, our community offers a wealth of resources, collaborative projects,
      and engaging discussions to help you grow in your tech journey.
    </p>

    <p>
      Join us to connect with like-minded individuals, share your experiences,
      and gain valuable insights. You'll find everything from coding tips to job
      leads, and most importantly, you'll discover a supportive network that
      values diversity and creativity. Come for the knowledge, stay for the
      culture—join our community and be part of something extraordinary.
    </p>

    <div class="links">
      <a
        href="https://discord.gg/hmm2urvdRf"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="button"
      >
        <span>join the discord</span>
        <img src="/logo.svg" alt="" class="button_logo" role="presentation" />
      </a>
      <div>
        <span>we got these, too 👀</span>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/blog">blog</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://bsky.app/profile/datcode.org">bluesky</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <footer>
    <p>&copy; DatCode.org</p>
  </footer>
</Root>
